{"unit_id":"yonchicy__dsh-composer-modenter#card-zh","repo":"yonchicy/dsh-composer-modenter","commit":"1b501da55fae5b5c697c19a2a356e93b6ce49af4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-modenter 是一款适用于 DeepSeek Harness 网页客户端的输入框快捷键插件。它通过浏览器端的按键监听调整消息编辑区的 Enter 行为：在普通输入状态下按 Enter 插入换行，按 Cmd+Enter 或 Ctrl+Enter 保持发送操作。插件会略过输入法组合输入和带修饰键的按键，并在斜杠或命令菜单打开时让 Enter 继续选择菜单项；如果原生键盘事件不可修改，则调用插入换行的编辑命令作为回退。它适合希望用 Enter 换行、同时保留快捷发送方式的 Web 用户。安装使用 DSH 的 web profile，无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:43-61","cordis.patch.yml:3-5","package.json:36-43"]}
{"unit_id":"yonchicy__dsh-composer-modenter#card-en","repo":"yonchicy/dsh-composer-modenter","commit":"1b501da55fae5b5c697c19a2a356e93b6ce49af4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-composer-modenter changes Enter behavior in the DeepSeek Harness web composer. Plain Enter inserts a line break; Cmd/Ctrl+Enter still sends. It skips IME composition and leaves Enter available to select command menu items. Install with the DSH web profile; no extra key or service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:43-61","cordis.patch.yml:3-5","package.json:36-43"]}
