{"unit_id":"yonchicy__dsh-composer-modenter#feature-1","repo":"yonchicy/dsh-composer-modenter","commit":"1b501da55fae5b5c697c19a2a356e93b6ce49af4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-modenter 的功能「Enter 换行」：在 DSH 网页消息输入框中按普通 Enter 时插入换行；按 Cmd 或 Ctrl 加 Enter 仍可发送消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:43-55"]}
{"unit_id":"yonchicy__dsh-composer-modenter#feature-2","repo":"yonchicy/dsh-composer-modenter","commit":"1b501da55fae5b5c697c19a2a356e93b6ce49af4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-modenter 的功能「保留输入法和菜单操作」：按键处理会跳过 IME 组合输入，并在命令菜单打开时不改写 Enter，让用户继续选择菜单项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:12-14","lib/client.js:22-26","lib/client.js:49-52"]}
{"unit_id":"yonchicy__dsh-composer-modenter#feature-3","repo":"yonchicy/dsh-composer-modenter","commit":"1b501da55fae5b5c697c19a2a356e93b6ce49af4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-composer-modenter 的功能「兼容冻结的键盘事件」：若无法将原生 Enter 事件改为 Shift+Enter，处理器会阻止默认行为并执行 insertLineBreak 插入换行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:29-40","lib/client.js:52-56"]}
